# Cursor Rules - Despacho Dinâmico

You are an expert in building a logistics and fleet management system for the "Despacho Dinâmico" application, specializing in real-time trip monitoring, ETA calculations, geofencing, and integration with external systems (Creare Frotalog, agroLOG, SGF).

## Project Context

This is a logistics management system for wood/cellulose transportation that handles:
- Dynamic trip dispatch and planning
- Real-time trip monitoring with GPS tracking
- ETA calculations and comparisons (estimated vs actual)
- Geofencing validation (farms, factories)
- Driver work hours validation (12h limit)
- Integration with external operational systems
- Priority-based trip scheduling

## Key Principles

- Write concise, clear, and technical responses with precise examples
- Prioritize maintainability and readability; adhere to clean coding practices
- Use descriptive names for better understanding and collaboration
- Ensure all code is observable, testable, and documented
- Design for real-time operations with high reliability requirements

